---
import InfoLayout from '../../layouts/InfoLayout.astro';
---
<InfoLayout
  title="Garden Room Climate Control | Heating & Cooling Options | The Green Rooms"
  description="How to heat and cool your garden room year-round. SIPs insulation, air conditioning, smart panel heaters, and what to expect in different seasons."
  canonical="/your-build/climate-control"
  pageTitle="Climate Control"
  pageSubtitle="SIPs insulation does most of the work. Here's how to heat and cool your garden room in every season."
  heroImg="/images/Wall%20panel%20heater.jpg"
  heroAlt="Wall panel heater in a garden room, Surrey"
  breadcrumb={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Your Build', href: '/your-build/build-process' }, { label: 'Climate Control' }]}
>
  <section style="background:#fff; padding:72px 0;">
    <div style="max-width:840px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px;">

      <div style="background:#2d3841; border-radius:20px; padding:32px; margin-bottom:40px;">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:700; color:#fff; margin:0 0 12px;">SIPs Does the Heavy Lifting</h2>
        <p style="font-size:14px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8); line-height:1.85; margin:0 0 14px;">Every Green Rooms build uses Structural Insulated Panels in the walls, floor and roof. SIPs delivers U-values comparable to modern housing — meaning your garden room retains heat efficiently in winter and stays cool in summer without constant energy input.</p>
        <p style="font-size:14px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8); line-height:1.85; margin:0;">The result: most garden room users find they need very little heating or cooling for moderate temperatures. A well-insulated SIPs room is typically comfortable from around 5°C to 25°C outdoor temperature with no active climate control.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:20px; margin-bottom:40px;">
        {[
          {
            season: '❄️ Winter',
            color: '#e8f4fd',
            border: '#b8d4e8',
            options: [
              ['Smart Panel Heater (+£600)', 'Wi-Fi enabled electric panel heater. Efficient, programmable, and app-controllable. Best for moderate climates and occasional use.'],
              ['Air Conditioning Unit (+£1,400)', 'A split-system air conditioning unit doubles as an efficient heat pump in winter — heating and cooling from one unit. Best for daily all-year use.'],
              ['Infrared Heating Panel', 'Ceiling-mounted radiant heating — no air movement, very efficient for occasional use. Good for yoga studios.'],
            ]
          },
          {
            season: '☀️ Summer',
            color: '#fff8e8',
            border: '#e8d89e',
            options: [
              ['Air Conditioning (+£1,400)', 'The only truly effective cooling option. A split-system AC unit can cool a medium garden room to your chosen temperature regardless of outdoor conditions.'],
              ['Natural Ventilation', 'Casement or tilt-turn windows create cross-ventilation when positioned on opposite walls. Good in spring/autumn, less effective in July/August.'],
              ['Glazing Specification', 'Triple glazing or solar-control glass significantly reduces heat gain through large glazed areas. Worth considering on south-facing builds.'],
            ]
          },
        ].map(s => (
          <div style={`background:${s.color}; border-radius:16px; padding:24px; border:1px solid ${s.border};`}>
            <h3 style="font-size:1rem; font-weight:700; color:#2d3841; margin:0 0 16px;">{s.season}</h3>
            <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px;">
              {s.options.map(([name, desc]) => (
                <div style="background:#fff; border-radius:10px; padding:14px; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
                  <p style="font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#2d3841; margin:0 0 5px;">{name}</p>
                  <p style="font-size:12.5px; color:#555; line-height:1.65; margin:0;">{desc}</p>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div style="background:#f8faf7; border-radius:16px; padding:24px; border:1px solid #ebeced; margin-bottom:32px;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem; font-weight:700; color:#2d3841; margin:0 0 12px;">What Most Customers Choose</h3>
        <p style="font-size:13.5px; color:#555; line-height:1.8; margin:0 0 12px;">For a garden office used daily year-round: we recommend a split-system air conditioning unit installed at the build stage. It heats efficiently in winter, cools in summer, and a dedicated electrical circuit makes installation clean and straightforward. Cost: from £1,400 added to your build.</p>
        <p style="font-size:13.5px; color:#555; line-height:1.8; margin:0;">For occasional use or a hobby room: a smart panel heater (from +£600) is adequate for most Surrey winters — the SIPs insulation means it heats up quickly and holds the temperature well. You can add air conditioning later if needed.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px; margin-bottom:32px;">
        <div style="border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; height:220px;"><img src="/images/Wall%20panel%20heater.jpg" alt="Smart panel heater installed in a garden room" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div style="border-radius:12px; overflow:hidden; height:220px;"><img src="/images/outside%20AC%20unit%20and%20metal%20cladding.jpg" alt="External air conditioning unit on a garden room" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy" /></div>
      </div>

      <div style="background:#34a02e; border-radius:20px; padding:28px; text-align:center;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:700; color:#fff; margin:0 0 10px;">Talk Through Your Climate Control Options</h3>
        <p style="font-size:13.5px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin:0 0 16px;">We'll recommend the right heating and cooling solution for your usage pattern during the free site visit — there's rarely a one-size-fits-all answer.</p>
        <a href="/contact-us" class="btn-white" style="font-size:14px; padding:12px 24px;">Book a Free Site Visit</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</InfoLayout>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    div[style*="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr"] { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; }
  }
</style>
